{1810}{37l
You can get bonuses at level 1,10,20,30,40 and 50 by talking to the guide spirit.
You need to choose the lower level bonus before the higher level ones.
The bonuses can be normal ones or power one.
The power bonus are much much better especially the ones that you can take at higher levels but you need to meet certain
criteria in order to select them.

Standard bonuses.
These bonuses are the standard ones and can be taken at level 1,10,20,30,40,50 by speaking to the ancestral spirit.
But if you can better take the power bonuses especially at higher levels because as you can see they are much better.

Speed lad/lass gives you +1 to speed Warning .

Max speed is capped to 18 so don’t take this if you play to raise dex

Lifegiver: gives you +5 to life.

Fatigue Giver: gives you +5 to fatigue.

Perception lad/lass: Raises you perception by 1. Will not increase stat above racial limit.

Smart lad/lass: Raises your intelligence by 1. Will not increase stat above
racial limit.

Mule lad/lass: Increases your carrying capacity by 1000. Warning .
Max carrying capacity is 10000 so don’t take this if you play to raise strength.
}
