Preq for this bonus: You are Disarm Taps Master, Pick Locks Master, Repair Master and
Healing Expert or Master.

Power bonus at level 50.
Ranged Master bonus: Increases your AC by 30%.
Preq for this bonus: You are Bow Master, Firearms Master, Throw Master and you have never been trained in Melee.
}

