{1137}{Do you want to possess an azram star ?  Well, we've just the solution!  The secret of the azram star has been found ! Combine a mystical chackram  with a black diamond the most magikal gem known to man and an azram star will be created.Unbelievable! Unfortunately you will still have to identify your azram star but this is nothing more than a small detail!}
{1138}{Create dwarven steel}
{1139}{Do you want to convert your dwarven ore to dwarven steel?  Well, we've just the solution!  The amazing property of the Kathorn Crystal will purify your dwarven ore.The end result of the alchemical reaction is dwarven steel.Unbelievable!}
{1140}{Create Diamond}
{1141}{Are you a little shot on diamonds?  Well, we've just the solution!  Combine your Kathorn Crystal and an Emerald.Both the Kathorn Crystal and the Emerald will be destroyed and a single diamond will appear in their place.  Unbelievable!}
