{1145}{Are you a little shot on Kathorn Crystals?  Well, we've just the solution!  Combine your emerald and one ruby.Both the emerald and the ruby will be destroyed and a single Kathorn Crystal will appear in their place.  Unbelievable!}
{1146}{Replicate poppy flowers}
{1147}{Tired of keeping too many poppy flowers in your inventory?  Well, we've just the solution!  Use the amazing replication powers of the ruby to create more poppy flowers on the spot.Five more poppy flowers will be created.  Unbelievable!}
{1148}{Replicate quinine}
{1149}{Tired of keeping too many quinine pills in your inventory?  Well, we've just the solution!  Use the amazing replication powers of the ruby to create more quinine pills on the spot.Five more quinine pills will be created.  Unbelievable!}
